{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56fd3eb8a51c564193cf73329731219bd340177eb3edbba4ad87299bf87c6790",
      "text": "Being there for you.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3daf22f1e69bdfc5b155624f9e0058e14b2a0733a43f0ca6cb07f480c1d5af1a",
      "text": "某天，FRAME接到了拍摄婚纱杂志的工作。\n对方似乎是看中了他们曾为公务员的“可靠感”才发来的邀约。\n然而，三人却怎么也无法把握具体的感觉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56fd3eb8a51c564193cf73329731219bd340177eb3edbba4ad87299bf87c6790",
      "text": "Being there for you.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33619ad29c185ff252c3a0aedb7eb6a3c0b792f9c6f6fa843c955ad8e4adc121",
      "text": "……啊！\n这边，这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b99371b17d327422866bf101fad860272efc92b8f36ec9ddc80ab32f05570599",
      "text": "早上好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4418baab9de21d47da52925fe2a3cb0ecd6555824ec9532ef7cd93fa7435320a",
      "text": "哎？你说因为纠结穿什么衣服和弄什么发型，\n结果赶在最后一秒才到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9bfb6dc496e923e60374e02c0c638c43163d146cfdb1d61da0851cfa3f67450",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。不过时间刚刚好哦。\n用不着这么着急忙慌的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6f1388b7bec441655a5b25353be2a6f26e05d5716e7df1695b02d13b41dfcf8",
      "text": "……哎？因为我发消息说到了？\n想早点见到我……哈哈，莫名有点害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c01eb1dfd3fd192410da1001e66334b14af0ca808fa72aae0c77b6a5d270144",
      "text": "不过，我也是一样的心情哦。\n因为太期待今天的约会，甚至都失眠了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04caf849dd781cd7de9286bbbcc2b6b66fd5594a64446d433e9c012789f6e4a6",
      "text": "好像催得太急了，真不好意思啊。\n今天就痛痛快快玩个够吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93e9b649853bd49b4d0b8a1d1832be9572c72b816c88472f9ffb03be1957d76a",
      "text": "本来还有点担心天气，\n今天能放晴真是太好了！真是绝佳的约会好日子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:108a157ba4354742af647b4922cf9757a2e3d34bf1b731c9b082713216edf4d3",
      "text": "那么，我们差不多该出发了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "数月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e50e5d3e8b24dabada94f49a28d5df3428ae30770b61980eab0e12258de21123",
      "text": "给FRAME的各位带来新工作了！\n而且这可是对方点名发来的直接邀约哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf57a75ba9e6ac20a8ae07651745d3e8d94146fa6c6bc3281bf723235c5dddd2",
      "text": "真的假的！指名我们……是这么回事吧。\n感觉真让人高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5361f964bd4556ec25589714c282f294fdb95f91863affab466ccd638afc7c3a",
      "text": "啊啊。\n那么，究竟是什么样的工作呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e815a772eadfee2fefee26812a464a0d0d39a0ff2973f584de2dcd4c0d80017f",
      "text": "是的！\n居然是……婚纱杂志的平面写真拍摄！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8512c036e08e05cef0f9e2312307a944ddbffbd10cc092d4177210d68b78359",
      "text": "婚纱杂志……？\n诚司先生，您以前看过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99c67b0c6856187be273286c266d7e0125436f0af20513524c97af495ffe1caf",
      "text": "不，没看过。\n对于我自己来说是相当陌生的杂志种类。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f4a86b0f4caca657d688bb5f435f9a76c8e96101f5fc0fa12ac0a38a2814f2f",
      "text": "让我看看……穿着礼服在教堂里\n拍摄，还有……约会风景的拍摄！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7cb6f05db8dd3018ce67ac2ae89bf9e900f13bf506614a814f7724971cce19a",
      "text": "约会！？\n我开始担心自己能不能胜任了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac15e09f1bc6422938669b142d45dbfd5bf37c94ba1ae80b2749b381a1f77e5",
      "text": "似乎并没有搭档演员，全都是个人的单独拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771aa9724ed121929ceb4031f0c8efc272c755bcc6908417552a0a3d743faa69",
      "text": "这样啊。既然如此……但是……\n……不，对方是看中我们才特地发来的邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53c279f7469d199f862a2aa06a5807725775bff64e21b572cb2920f593f8f412",
      "text": "嗯。为了不辜负这份期待，全力以赴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b35d6291e46da415a5e4c2356204b78f65fbdac85b5c9ea148d051e71980708",
      "text": "英雄先生、诚司先生……\n说的也是呢！我也会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56d4c8249791722caba264c0571e4e1ea6006db99be34b5f411461abec2212cb",
      "text": "与杂志编辑的商讨会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:839e4c7dd16e802b71cc97aaa778e806b6b6a7bd3f54c3e2720535b21db6a58c",
      "text": "FRAME的各位，这次非常感谢各位\n能够接受我们的邀约！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c46b0d7aba5d21af2a7ee0e6a5556d0de1d6d33ad260cdc18d0784b7c17970",
      "text": "哪里，我们才该感谢您的看重。……顺便想问一下，\n能冒昧请教一下邀约我们的理由吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:987010b2985a990c06c0b8ed6e1befad2b76bfb0566de4c69845b9834e6e5191",
      "text": "好的。各位拥有曾是公务员这一独特的背景\n对吧。加上这份背景给予人的印象与各位的人品，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c72e8d614c05831685aa08ab2eb94e0df87608d22c3d5042250727bef701e6",
      "text": "在我们杂志的读者问卷中，也屡次作为\n给人十足安全感的理想男友被提及姓名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cc98060af9f880016d595a8a012d691ab51cc1c747a92dad0cb212ad961a573",
      "text": "因此，我们希望做一期聚焦于各位身上的这份“可靠感”的\n专题企划，才冒昧提出了这次的合作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2c12962d490414f2f16d25c8dc22a5e06aecee8f6846c13ba44b5d12c3ad073",
      "text": "原来如此。既然是这样的话，\n我们就更得加把劲才行了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6db79685536e38d6fd943f93b4eecba085b33de54637f85501e8a87bcacbd90",
      "text": "首先是在海边和街头取景，\n最后再去教堂拍摄对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44e0a10a4adf684028dc95f41e161cbbf0b487ca6c7a03360ac7d9d16de702df",
      "text": "是的！这也蕴含着记录两人携手走过的\n时光这一层深意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a9a3c4a661b9233aed24c6f5287bb6b4b14afa931c425280fec215d84b44512",
      "text": "也就是记录通往婚姻的每一个珍贵瞬间啊……\n感觉好浪漫呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f65ca90c871b38db2d0461892410409ce9ae397a6724502b0c16bce4af0c2b5",
      "text": "为了能拍出优秀的照片，我们也会全力以赴的。\n接下来就请多多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45a2639bee133f79fa257c83a1284145a61c3e0a2c5692309a6e2fb52ad44dc9",
      "text": "练习室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62eaf177d82b26f9e9462d88572fa8011874e82dab529b11bea364c366e83832",
      "text": "是、是这种感觉吗……？\n你们两个觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9159872b5cf1e9524b399b94ca00d1d4658c20ce5e8753da01a4ea72805d16c",
      "text": "嗯——……笑容有点僵硬，看起来有点吓人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7edf3db6833a8efe43882c2a1b52b80a8014fc426634e9cef21a23259c450f3",
      "text": "看上去可不像是在街上\n给女朋友搭一把手的场景呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:954b555ff531cae21c540aee23a81da05404463dd6436957a763c5c637cb10f5",
      "text": "啰嗦。\n我这也是很努力在笑了好不好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10a626e8a3c2ee5be4bef2cd51d7d81148dd47fdc07c3f4e5270b772eb6f099c",
      "text": "哈哈，连我都感受到英雄的紧张了。\n来。看看刚才拍下的照片确认一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88c72f0e9710fb0c385007850d91305bb0d5d9c0b9ba5bf5f56a6af3eca0a486",
      "text": "啊——……这个确实有点……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56590e669e76c9e20fa11e708954f669a8aa65f6238c48c0ac85e8fd8fb6b995",
      "text": "看吧，我就说是这样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6c5f4a3d36fbfd881035221f55e0fe2aa9d01f07f0490868cf0f46307becdf5",
      "text": "虽然特意看了爱情电影之类的去学习，\n但看别人演和自己来演果然是两码事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e81896177702d2936491fb6ec11f57fe0521995c413d0c7fab3dca6126228a83",
      "text": "总之，接下来换我来试一次。\n如果有什么觉得不对劲的地方，尽管指出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd2748a4dfe7331bef4c8c12eefd190e0261d772e17d624cc8157221848aae9d",
      "text": "稍、稍微打扰一下。\n…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:753c3e86c8ebf4813f000912946676be0833503fbb4f78406809d6bac823cf34",
      "text": "……诚司先生？\n怎么一直伸着手，愣在那里不说话了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7a736e366a18bad6529d742ec7c0e0ae0db6a06faaf560800b7bf8e6452eafb",
      "text": "不……我在想该如何向对方搭话，\n一时语塞了。接下来又该做些什么呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5935b602beb71a564ed1419b5777d5b2d90f8564cb286781aa8f427bf9310597",
      "text": "既然这样，干脆把对手戏的对象当成是我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1bd7ad0124e79d4bd78eae37b95a8cd78fb8dc716cf9c8279671cada7a3d510",
      "text": "哈哈，心意我领了。\n不过如果对手是你，可就完全算不上约会了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e9200c8c44ad4fb637dc8c81a3c7a5ab5b8b0ad55fd369229abb24a20ff1de",
      "text": "说的也是呢。啊哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2cb36cc75f7d478a5c5abc4770dee90f43415c155efffffd5f0bab96b0d9897",
      "text": "看样子信玄的情况也差不多啊。再这样下去，\n想拍出所谓的“可靠男友”的感觉可就难了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3985e636aff3805575c111347bfec715dfcea4ea30b9419a3cc2167b020afe",
      "text": "有没有什么好办法呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53546cda52874cc6e7b5bfcb2bffdd2e7ba55ed8deaa21472bb0b4a39982ca87",
      "text": "……不好意思，\n看着各位刚才的样子，我突然想到了一个点子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a30d35e65eb40d0c5ecc864ea3f2878cd6e75bf2cad484c1229a6949c9e17cc",
      "text": "干脆当作是在“演戏”，各位觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b48344afb9bc3ec428a19f1b832d37d837a81584dd698318f7f07be714ba01d",
      "text": "演戏？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af0cc3ab90eed48a96cca60dbb72f51eff299fd1c7cf2de9aefa498572d1357c",
      "text": "是的。淡化“这是我自己”的意识，\n当成是演戏的一环……把自己当成在扮演恋人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d5683eb06335501e9e47d05dc74847afb65d938d0de5cabec2f03839b16c51d",
      "text": "我觉得这样或许多少能减轻一些抗拒感……\n大家意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7f50174152af9c8fcf68f54eda221d8839cdb33c714dbda4ce9341a8cbf3913",
      "text": "原来如此，正因为觉得是自己本人，\n所以有些台词才难以启齿啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d20d8e005a78723e6e2975352eb017d2cb56706989934253a1abda5ba1c9291",
      "text": "我马上试着做做看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2b9f863810ee996b6ca7b088deb34ff7c9d7d585fc4dad8b06996e6ab9cfa19",
      "text": "（……我拍摄的情景是，\n在街头和恋人约会……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0e6f8ed7c86387e055cddcb480d044fcb51c0897dc7cfe3b49c9e141a58c9d6",
      "text": "（中途突然下起了雨，\n伸手护住对方，这种情景……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22d7fc39d634a1f2a3c0dbe6609b48ed8a3f2938730479217d03717a865a1bab",
      "text": "……好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aec2f529887f276a2f89a9ca914df3d1b8e246bc408d4d55244de383a4dfca1",
      "text": "早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000116:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35d3dc4c0848f24351adf4a5806a3390e0304d371b27d2b7d428eab414711b10",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be1b163d883357ac8615ab481c3a71981fa67da0cc8fc70e5a7c83330b7bc865",
      "text": "现在方便讲两句吗？\n我想向你汇报一下练习的情况。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000120:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79873eb5a661cccbcea968492bf02f49b02737221c118e386d421c0041625e0d",
      "text": "还顺利吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88a91217d3bfcfec6335b6a620ac10e1b2d2d31bd8519f3593fb00eb5060dc0b",
      "text": "勉勉强强吧。\n虽然生硬的地方还是挺多的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49d9fb2ed5f2221cb5c49ef207f78427159caad26cc4ace1274da0677c2047eb",
      "text": "不过，比起最开始已经好上太多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:888eda1aeb4033328b090460ce299b724174f3751effe7a37451c2fcafdadb6d",
      "text": "说判若两人……可能有点夸张，\n但确实大有长进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60bd5342120378b8c8f4a16ecd100f6c8387b40731b118d1e7c14d26cc266638",
      "text": "这也都多亏了●●●●プロデューサー的\n建议啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8528efd88e2e83dd6ab4bb5245b9314bc44ac51fbc452cc7e91c04e3c21686b2",
      "text": "托你那个提议的福，总算是找到了努力的方向。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_f:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84e504780de8b72812f269ca821f0f674efb637a8ef88c361ad71d77eee571f6",
      "text": "……哎呀，都这个时间了。\n那就下次开会再聊。到时候拜托你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dfc691860edf8a8605f6dd775421c419ea8d76f6ff1c3835869cc5db7bf0900",
      "text": "终于，明天就是正式拍摄了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8911356727768373e13f2cdc7ec48bead4d747099357e84bbaa36fce34126c04",
      "text": "龙是在街头约会。英雄是在黄昏的海边\n求婚……是这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:363529ceb800a0443f6ad4d45f5690fabb53d6d8c0dff85196974a84cd988876",
      "text": "是的！诚司先生是在商场里\n购物的情景对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c6911f8feb1d5b0373c82669069343360155ade065b8348fdcc9491a20542c2",
      "text": "嗯，没错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a9fb33c506dd45fce228dc768a96c904532d65ad5da3610654a6b655453bbf",
      "text": "各位，状态调整得如何了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e68ddf8b8f20b4247ac639dda2e490912203e9e0a545249867a69781e0f82de",
      "text": "完美！\n只要不出什么倒霉的意外的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:294131c7a0123c3019f505fbd3d9ecf41dd70db6ad4e4f2b46438ce0bd812fd9",
      "text": "诚司先生和英雄先生都表现得超有范儿。\n平时的拼命练习终于出成效了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d4a8268ca4fef1c694d8104365f0522c6aa107973259c0ba9d3dce8fb0adf96",
      "text": "一度还在担心会变成什么样，\n好在总算是像模像样了，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7076c4853b9593237d930e64b0e6390bf7b4c0aa3abce20ece4a11f612cfe23",
      "text": "好，明天一定要圆满成功。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_g:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:503e60e31e6c17f6b1764d7641fcd4e0a9debf34b973bcff35b97aa2e18b3b07",
      "text": "是啊。\n去吓那些拍摄人员一跳吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205b537162a622d6c13223069f400d4e8d55bf55b3cd45c60b78e4ab8e51e99c",
      "text": "拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:108a157ba4354742af647b4922cf9757a2e3d34bf1b731c9b082713216edf4d3",
      "text": "那么，我们差不多该出发了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:748b129d826701ec346ac04881323b0c42f68e2713b43269db6bba91fd2f9af0",
      "text": "哇啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfe54bcf0cb84dbea2677f305a5e7ee38fa0ab32e8be2f0a4e384d776adea45b",
      "text": "（摄影师被台阶绊到了……！\n糟了，得接住他！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2c4540a27586b0a5f27db7407c3bbda99720dab3d3ae57009a10feb4c57d79e",
      "text": "呼……\n您没事吧？有没有撞到哪里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15dac16de2de1d6247060c486711f1bd148a624e19fcc131b621c35de0a9e608",
      "text": "抱、抱歉……\n刚才那个角度太难得，一时没忍住……啊哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc58eb43cc2115e1f7893dd3caac16095c529425ca5d132b031be1015172a00c",
      "text": "我没有受伤，没事的。\n而且，拍到了绝妙的好照片！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92d1d87daf79663f03d96d0a27bef0d6d22a8f5217c9bef3c42beb3ee3a71abf",
      "text": "哈哈，那就好。\n我也很期待照片的效果呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd8fbfe139a0df6c46832451e40c6d4ab49fa67e7ff3c2973d4ec1528a6cab6b",
      "text": "好的，刚才真不好意思。\n非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a5f40dde307f3fc843a1d83e75cff43bf510715d1cca8eb5c50457e885b745",
      "text": "那么，收拾好心情重新开始吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e59abf40bccfdbb56e8244c10e31a81e307656a0fdc188180155f68a55bab0",
      "text": "买了不少东西呢。\n能买到心仪的物品真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ee94e07393694413348a0eec1674dc19ab78774eaea368f3f9f977a918c1a0",
      "text": "帮你拿行李？别在意。\n这点分量，一点也不重。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e2d8af88f532670b56948e95ff76f2e6115605d77e0d2138000d313b07395a2",
      "text": "作为谢礼，今晚可以做任何我想吃的菜？\n让我想想……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17505b664cee28e69fd82b7641dee11e914f1d425f5f55f25267f48d0694308a",
      "text": "那么，就拜托汉堡肉排了。\n那是我的最爱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d53f86c2c59ea1b84c042db34b7d7c61668e70bc01abf3ea9449cdac9ac7b42",
      "text": "嗯？……啊，夕阳真美啊。\n能和你一起看真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:437a416a7d6d35e80d08278877efb83f65693f70cfa4acf6248ad7331577e510",
      "text": "……那个。我有话想对你说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac29bab78fa5aefd1758bc6648b97dcbfd813565bbab00be65541a72f2cfd597",
      "text": "我一定会让你幸福。\n所以……请和我结婚吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95cd8cac62d5462ac2045c89c724a596d246863132bd6b763c6300c544f82faa",
      "text": "辛苦各位了。\n拍出来的照片非常出色哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a5960c1f8ca2555978aef02cddecfc16fb67b55d6fe730c4f695340e25d0f5",
      "text": "多谢。\n能得到你这样的夸奖，真让人高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:856ca77b6d022d97fd9d5d1485cf758521c559a04e2e42fbc669994a96f12f7e",
      "text": "英雄，辛苦了。\n我也觉得拍得很棒。练习的成果充分展现出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bec115f5575dfb6cd86706d0e9592ece7cb634e74b6f184237b91ae59929083",
      "text": "明天终于要迎来在教堂的拍摄了呢。\n更加打起精神去面对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b98dee34a5521b50de7e66404132514387e3061c11304b475c3cd4241a9bb9d",
      "text": "说的没错！明天也一起加油吧！\n按今天的状态，肯定没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000203:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a48347e91a066de6721bb22433394f7acbe01bc2aa53e603a9b0a7b3f1249a3",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n话说回来，今天的拍摄，\n大家感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b0bfdc064b8cad33231ba1749136005be8f97c6202b6b6432ce89551c71471f",
      "text": "商场里的情侣\n挺多的。\n托这个的福演得很自然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000207:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8b5f71906c19fe0f647a6ad309b18e0e82bd59bca6851fb68c842cfc0c58389",
      "text": "在海边看到的夕阳也很漂亮。\n按那样的状态，我觉得应该\n拍出好照片了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db1b76da8e7ee5eb9581d61b13bcfa1e67361ae4ac6a2fb359824ed8fbc00dc1",
      "text": "就是说嘛！\n我也发挥出最佳水平了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000211:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:730da59fe6d574d6dcb633e9a5a0f542e51c9b75aaa51fa1f477bd92298e68b4",
      "text": "刚听说接的是婚纱杂志的工作时，\n最开始真不知道\n会搞成什么样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000213:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:078b677fb23ad999970eca092866f14b4b8918a79d6fc110db1bf2b801a9cd28",
      "text": "同感。\n不过总算是跨过了第一道\n难关，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb4acc457165657cbfed3c2d0507910e0d586479ff10aeab2eeea81732fedabc",
      "text": "明天就是难度最大的\n教堂拍摄了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000217:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eaecc26b99d0122610bdc79ebfa4bd81431d00dc60c4cfa172d9c1991572e1f",
      "text": "确实。\n要是能保持这股势头\n就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000219:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac45b6855021e10962477f5af1f545f3e25f3d1397bf8a1a1c5c53306cfe0cc",
      "text": "没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000219:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd5873d76980e153c7a0f61f6b1eff967c6725ca2aa0b7868ed3180b9e2a5cfc",
      "text": "没问题的。\n请对自己有信心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000221:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b830711a2687955656c5a3412e6517a8ac8660fdabbc4960e2bd827fd412a71e",
      "text": "谢啦。\n听你这么一说\n心里轻松多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_i:cmd-000223:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11863e668b4e472694a4fd6af59fe71beac56165439d81e9b08d4e19b73a1169",
      "text": "不论如何，\n明天都要端正心态去迎战。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11890ad2e863a7149b97e9bd3296024bcbc5f6afeba988aa15175b091188c166",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n怎么样……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3151b8117beddb63f1969b34d4919711e3447f25ed5290dcf0c49d577f0bdf4",
      "text": "非常合适！显得非常帅气！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ae938bd610f7db29cf88367bf71ad0e2217dfb394bc1f9f1a9068fc7252c92c",
      "text": "太好了！\n我还担心会不会看起来像过七五三的小孩一样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdae6349ec5463bb48f00fac8e72733a285f7498036df36aed3b74f014a41c7a",
      "text": "平时难得穿一次无尾礼服，\n总觉得怪紧张的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b189c383f3a1df3bbd45fe0a353540db7578ac1f50bc27398356914ea0972c92",
      "text": "英雄穿起来也很合身哦。\n要有自信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba38d7e5b054b7f6da057c0b523ed235ab3cf943d23c3f1b94896d280e2e2cb6",
      "text": "让大家久等了。\n木村龙先生，请做好就位准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:181ac237e36fab4f4d5b75afa3ba0117bd6ea7fa0702757a574c690a37b1fb37",
      "text": "那么，我先去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:723edacfdcce05098b0e1356858d5777de952fb1d2d0fbdc45194244d91cfccb",
      "text": "嗯，去加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_j:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9624eee9ea973affff8d08409be2d48432a8b8883e35afb00b62a56ff9acd12",
      "text": "我们就在这里看着你呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21f466959b384a6122bfb71493baa3fc3836b36ad31ffca7b7eda120ee873b3c",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95058e429b96b86db2c5904191163643fb8b77a034ebd0d02bdccc2e97685e67",
      "text": "“想拥有这样的婚姻！”特辑吗。\n再次在杂志上读到，还挺让人不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39207e08b5f0c827e02b5e623720afff8b0b44fbc709c6a2aedf5c89d0981e81",
      "text": "不过，大家的神情都很不错。\n特别是龙的这张照片，很有安全感，真棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5218d219dfef7b9ee209ea64166253d439f9c6dcacab5d41da270436e3309fa6",
      "text": "啊，这是接住摄影师先生时的照片呢。\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39fb56cc42d5bd7ee5a94572cb5f1c7e8c0ab5b1a97df0b7726930bd8b232fcb",
      "text": "杂志的销量似乎也非常喜人哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10619cea84d7399810db48eacb4cedfeb3c34b8d68799aed390956d58ab977f4",
      "text": "我家里人好像也买了……一想到\n客厅里就摆着这个，感觉有点难为情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cba47b477fbb4e1ee3e820b351d5392de7b12507bdc8b00dd437fcf737c49efe",
      "text": "我家那边也是一样啊。\n而且大家还人手买了一本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a32b53ceb9b12158822a440cb447883fd88e27420cdccf5a4bbe5653b878b184",
      "text": "哈哈，虽然确实让人略感害羞，\n不过能得到支持，也是一件值得感激的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c9a6acd73484cadbaa87a695350a4d1615ead52a6074bbaa6ed97e5e1f607d5",
      "text": "说的也是。起初还不知道会变成什么样，\n能拍出好照片真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398db1ee1566e721c170f90a68f1a08cf3855c7817732b9ab2f047919b94cacb",
      "text": "接触了不熟悉的领域，\n总觉得自己的戏路和业务范围也拓宽了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfe6e515a9b3747eee894b76184348b7823f4a7e92f4a86bf5fcb642b3931a97",
      "text": "能接下这份工作真是太好了。\n●●●●プロデューサー，下次也请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
